	(text "RTHR 1k MELF 0.25 W, RSENSE 562R, CIN 10n: VIH <= 10.95 V, VIL >= 8.7 V, 2.25 mA -> type 1 and 3.\nSUB pins go to a floating 2 x 2 mm copper island only (datasheet), never to FGND. FGND = DIF_GND.\nDI8 = E-stop channel B: drives the chain directly; DI8 to CTRL through 1k."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 253.1 0)
		(effects
